        <mxCell id="Y5IgDsyA5UMn8laPzqXE-28" value="(9)&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;CXOR&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The 8-bit XOR checksum ensures the integrity of the frame&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;CXOR = 0xFF ^ Node ID ^ Endpoint ^ CMDID ^ CMDTYPE ^ Payload ^ Sequence&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="Y5IgDsyA5UMn8laPzqXE-1">
