        <mxCell id="Y5IgDsyA5UMn8laPzqXE-25" value="(6) Command Type:&amp;nbsp;Message type&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;+&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Set: Control message from HOST to device&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;+ GET: Request message for device information and status from HOST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;+ RES:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The message reports the information and status of the device to the HOST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;container=0;strokeWidth=0;spacing=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;horizontal=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="Y5IgDsyA5UMn8laPzqXE-1">
